Type: Feature
Needs Documentation: yes

Added an "Enable order management" switch at the top of the Kustom Order Management settings, for merchants who capture, cancel and refund in the Kustom portal instead of in WooCommerce. Turning it off stops WooCommerce from capturing, cancelling, updating and refunding the Kustom order, removes the Kustom refund option and the return fee fields from the WooCommerce refund UI, and hides the rest of the section since those settings no longer apply. The manual actions in the order metabox remain available. The switch is enabled by default, so existing stores are unaffected.
